# Cargo build output, at any depth (workspace root, fuzz crates, tools).
# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: do not add it here.
target/

# Backup files written by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# Debug information from MSVC builds of rustc
*.pdb

# cargo-mutants working data
**/mutants.out*/

# cargo-fuzz findings and coverage (proptest-regressions/ is committed, not ignored)
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/coverage/

# Profiling and coverage output
*.profraw
*.profdata
flamegraph.svg
perf.data*

# Python (tools/beamviz): the environment uv makes, and caches. uv.lock is committed.
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Secrets and per-machine environment. Commit a `.env.example` instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Editors and IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Claude Code per-machine settings (the shared settings.json, agents and commands belong in git)
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# macOS
.DS_Store
